namespace UObjectToolTips

DreamToggle {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamToggle.h#DreamToggle
    src   "A toggle whose hierarchy is code, not an asset.\n\nThe same four nodes BP_Toggle has -- a box, a tick inside it, a label beside it -- built in\nNativeOnInitialized instead of instanced from a template. What that buys is that the control\ncannot be half-built: BP_Button shipped for months with no UIButton on it and nothing said so,\nand a class that always adds its own behaviour cannot have that happen to it.\n\nWhat it costs is the tree nobody can open. Everything an author would otherwise have reached into\nthe hierarchy to change has to be a property here, which is what FDreamToggleStyle is, and the\nmoment a project wants all its toggles to agree that stops being enough.\n\nIt composes into .dui with no language change at all, because a class path is already a node tag:\n\n    Native.Toggle Mute {\n        Style.TickChecked = #FF3355\n        OnToggleChanged -> HandleMute\n    }\n\nDeliberately label-less: a check box is one square and its mark, and the text beside it is the\nconsumer's layout. Pair it with a Text node in whatever row the screen wants.\n\nAPI-wise it speaks UMG's check box: CheckedState (Unchecked/Checked/Undetermined) with\nGetCheckedState/SetCheckedState, IsChecked/SetIsChecked, and OnCheckStateChanged. bIsOn with\nGetIsOn/SetIsOn and OnToggleChanged are the compatibility spelling of the two-state subset and\nstay fully bindable; the two spellings mirror each other through every path, and when authored\nvalues disagree CheckedState wins (see ReconcileCheckSpellings).\n\nThe third state is the control's own. The behaviour underneath stays two-state and is parked at\nunchecked while Undetermined stands; the tick swaps its check mark for a bar in the TickChecked\ncolour. A click leaves Undetermined by becoming unchecked, as UMG's SCheckBox does."
    text  "层级结构由代码而非资产构建的开关。\n\n与 BP_Toggle 相同的四个节点——一个方框、方框内的勾选标记、旁边的标签——在\nNativeOnInitialized 中构建，而不是从模板实例化。这样做的好处是控件不可能只建一半：\nBP_Button 曾在没有 UIButton 的情况下发布了好几个月，却没有任何提示，而一个始终\n自行添加行为的类不会遇到这种情况。\n\n代价是一棵谁也打不开的树。作者原本需要深入层级结构去修改的一切，在这里都必须\n是属性，FDreamToggleStyle 正是如此；而一旦某个项目希望它的所有开关都保持一致，\n这就不再够用了。\n\n它能原封不动地组合进 .dui，因为类路径本身就已经是节点标签：\n\n    Native.Toggle Mute {\n        Style.TickChecked = #FF3355\n        OnToggleChanged -> HandleMute\n    }\n\n刻意不带标签：复选框就是一个方块和它的标记，旁边的文字属于使用者的布局。\n把它与 Text 节点搭配，放进屏幕所需的任意行中。\n\n在 API 层面，它沿用 UMG 复选框的接口：CheckedState（Unchecked/Checked/Undetermined）\n配合 GetCheckedState/SetCheckedState、IsChecked/SetIsChecked 以及\nOnCheckStateChanged。bIsOn 配合 GetIsOn/SetIsOn 和 OnToggleChanged 是两态子集的\n兼容写法，并且完全可绑定；两种写法在每条路径上互为镜像，当作者设置的取值冲突时，\n以 CheckedState 为准（见 ReconcileCheckSpellings）。\n\n第三个状态是控件自己的。底层行为仍是两态，在 Undetermined 成立期间保持在未选中；\n勾选标记会换成一个 TickChecked 颜色的横条。单击会让 Undetermined 变为未选中，\n与 UMG 的 SCheckBox 一致。"
    state machine
}

DreamToggle:AcceptedMouseButtons {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamToggle.h#DreamToggle:AcceptedMouseButtons
    src   "WHICH mouse buttons press and flip this check box -- a bitmask over EDreamUIMouseButtonType, the\nleft button alone by default, which is UMG's rule: SCheckBox toggles on the left button and\nnothing else, so a right click neither presses nor flips it and goes on to whatever is behind.\n\nUDreamButton's knob, for the same reason and with the same spelling (in .dui a number, one bit\nper EDreamUIMouseButtonType value: 1 is Left, 4 is Right). A touch and a gamepad or keyboard\npress always count. Pushed onto the behaviour with the three methods above."
    text  "决定哪些鼠标按键能按下并切换此复选框——基于 EDreamUIMouseButtonType 的位掩码，\n默认只有左键，这也是 UMG 的规则：SCheckBox 只在左键上切换，其他按键都不行，\n因此右键既不会按下也不会切换它，而是继续传给后面的内容。\n\n这是 UDreamButton 的同名旋钮，出于同样的原因、采用同样的写法（在 .dui 中是一个\n数字，每个 EDreamUIMouseButtonType 值占一位：1 是 Left，4 是 Right）。触摸以及\n手柄或键盘按键始终计入。它通过上述三个方法推送到行为上。"
    state machine
}

DreamToggle:bIsOn {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamToggle.h#DreamToggle:bIsOn
    src   "The compatibility spelling: CheckedState as a bool. Checked mirrors true; Unchecked and\nUndetermined mirror false. Kept as a property because existing .dui two-way-binds it\n(`bIsOn <-> ...`) and a binding resolves a property; kept coherent with CheckedState through\nevery path (authored push, user click, programmatic set). New code speaks CheckedState."
    text  "兼容写法：以布尔值表示的 CheckedState。Checked 对应 true；Unchecked 和\nUndetermined 对应 false。之所以保留为属性，是因为现有的 .dui 会对它做双向绑定\n（`bIsOn <-> ...`），而绑定解析的是属性；它在每条路径上（作者赋值、用户单击、\n程序设置）都与 CheckedState 保持一致。新代码请使用 CheckedState。"
    state machine
}

DreamToggle:BoxNode {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamToggle.h#DreamToggle:BoxNode
    src   "The parts, in the shape the rest of the framework expects to find them.\n\nUPROPERTY rather than bare pointers on purpose: a part nothing reflects is a part the designer,\nthe write-back and the bindings cannot see. Transient because they are rebuilt on every\ninitialization and never belong to a saved package."
    text  "各个部件，按框架其余部分期望的形式提供。\n\n有意使用UPROPERTY而非裸指针：无法被反射的部件，设计器、\n回写和绑定都看不到。标记为Transient，因为它们会在每次\n初始化时重建，且从不属于已保存的包。"
    state machine
}

DreamToggle:CheckedState {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamToggle.h#DreamToggle:CheckedState
    src   "The authored state, in UMG's spelling and with UMG's third value. A click moves it the way UMG's\ncheck box does: Unchecked to Checked, and Checked or Undetermined to Unchecked -- a mixed state\nis cleared by a click, never ticked. A property rather than the getter/setter pair alone,\nbecause the pair alone is invisible: .dui writes properties, the designer lists properties, and\na binding resolves a property -- so a knob that exists only as two UFUNCTIONs is a knob nothing\noutside C++ can turn.\n\nIt is the authored value going in and a mirror of the behaviour's coming out;\nHandleValueChanged keeps it honest when the user is the one who changed it. Where it and\nbIsOn are authored to disagree, this spelling wins."
    text  "作者设置的状态，采用 UMG 的写法，也采用 UMG 的第三个值。单击会像 UMG 的复选框\n那样改变它：从未选中变为已选中，而已选中或不确定变为未选中——混合状态只会被单击\n清除，绝不会被勾选。它是属性，而不只是 getter/setter 对，因为仅有一对函数是不可见的：\n.dui 写入的是属性，设计器列出的是属性，绑定解析的也是属性——所以一个仅以两个\nUFUNCTION 存在的旋钮，\n是 C++ 之外任何东西都拧不动的旋钮。\n\n它既是传入的作者取值，也是行为输出结果的镜像；\n当改动来自用户时，HandleValueChanged 会让它保持同步。当它与\nbIsOn 的作者取值冲突时，以此写法为准。"
    state machine
}

DreamToggle:ClickMethod {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamToggle.h#DreamToggle:ClickMethod
    src   "WHEN the tick flips, per input kind -- UMG's three enums, surfaced at the control exactly as\nUDreamButton surfaces them and for the same reason: they live on the selectable underneath,\nand a control that never stated them left every check box on the desktop's DownAndUp."
    text  "勾选标记在何时翻转，按输入类型区分——UMG 的三个枚举，在控件上暴露的方式与\nUDreamButton 完全相同，原因也相同：它们位于底层的可选择对象上，而一个从不声明\n它们的控件会让所有复选框都停留在桌面平台的 DownAndUp 上。"
    state machine
}

DreamToggle:GetCheckedState {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamToggle.h#DreamToggle:GetCheckedState
    src   "The full state. The behaviour is the truth for the two states it can hold; Undetermined is\nthe control's own and reads from here."
    text  "完整状态。对于行为所能持有的两个状态，以行为为准；Undetermined 是控件自己的\n状态，从此处读取。"
    state machine
}

