DreamToggle:IsPressed {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamToggle.h#DreamToggle:IsPressed
    src   "Whether a pointer is holding the box down -- UMG's IsPressed, which a check box has for the\nsame reason a button does. Asked of the behaviour rather than remembered here: a second copy\nof \"is it down\" goes stale the first time a press ends somewhere this control does not hear."
    text  "指针是否正按着框 —— UMG 的 IsPressed，复选框拥有它，原因与按钮相同。\n向行为询问，而不是在这里记住：“是否按下”的第二份副本，会在某次按压结束于\n此控件听不到的地方时第一次失效。"
    state machine
}

