DreamToggle:OnCheckStateChanged {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamToggle.h#DreamToggle:OnCheckStateChanged
    src   "UMG's spelling of the same moment, carrying the full state. Fires whenever CheckedState\nchanges -- alongside OnToggleChanged when the bool projection moved too."
    text  "UMG 对同一时刻的写法，携带完整状态。每当 CheckedState\n变化时触发 —— 当布尔投影也发生变化时，与 OnToggleChanged 一同触发。"
    state machine
}

DreamToggle:OnPressed {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamToggle.h#DreamToggle:OnPressed
    src   "The four pointer moments, re-broadcast from the behaviour exactly as the value change is.\n\nA check box is a button that keeps a value, and every argument for a button speaking about\npress and hover applies to it unchanged -- a sound on press, a tooltip on hover, a row that\nhighlights while the pointer is over its box. Press and release are the POINTER's rather than\nthe click's: a press that slides off releases without ever toggling. A disabled toggle\nbroadcasts neither of the press pair."
    text  "四个指针时刻，像值变化一样从行为重新广播。\n\n复选框是保存值的按钮，\n所有支持按钮播报按下与悬停的理由都原样适用——按下时播放声音、\n悬停时显示工具提示、指针位于框上时高亮一行。\n按下与释放属于指针，而非点击：滑出后释放的按压从不切换。\n禁用的切换控件不会广播按下这一对中的任何一个。"
    state machine
}

DreamToggle:OnToggleChanged {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamToggle.h#DreamToggle:OnToggleChanged
    src   "Fired by the toggle underneath, re-broadcast here so a consumer never has to reach into the\nparts. The compatibility spelling of OnCheckStateChanged: fires whenever the BOOL projection\nof the state changes (so Unchecked <-> Undetermined moves are silent here)."
    text  "由底层的切换控件触发，在此重新广播，使使用方无需深入内部部件。\nOnCheckStateChanged 的兼容写法：每当状态的 BOOL 投影变化时触发\n（因此 Unchecked <-> Undetermined 的变动在此静默）。"
    state machine
}

DreamToggle:OnValueChangedBP {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamToggle.h#DreamToggle:OnValueChangedBP
    src   "The `<->` convention: two-way bindings synthesize their reverse route against this exact\nname, so a value control carries it alongside its spoken events. Fires with them."
